  "First letters C, D, G, M, N, O are user's choice: a project legend must define them; llull reports them as PID_TAG_USER_LETTER (info).",
  "DEXPI does not restrict the category / function strings (DEXPI 1.4 spec 9.23.9, S3); the DEXPI reference P&ID uses IEC 62424-style codes such as PICSA."
